  "doc": "I82's dry run of the blind_agreement metric (P8; the prompt's steps 1-5). The blind side is the lead's own records re-made into a scratch tree S from the base commit's clean tree, with the local checker (bend 2.0.36 through a bun that is not the pinned build: the local gate's GENV refuses its fingerprint, so the pinned-checker gate checks were not run here). M0 and M1 were re-made in full and M3 for every PAR law outside PAR-init (I28's PAR-init law is decided on the versioned machine, and M3's other rules are re-made on CI runners). The laws are copied, not re-derived. tree/ and lead/ are B6 projections (holon compare --snapshot): the law files byte for byte and each record as {law_id, status}. compare.json is holon compare --blind tree --lead lead. The repository's results/ and gen/ did not change (git status).",
